{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Encodable.encode(to:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/encode(to:)"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"encode","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"encoder","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encoder","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7EncoderP"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"encode"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s7EncoderP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Encoder"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV6encode2toys7Encoder_p_tKF","title":"encode(to:)","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping\/encode(to:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GroupMapping"}],"title":"GroupMapping","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One row of the group-mapping table (G-3, T23.3.4, D-30): a directory group, named by its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguished name, and the AXIAM group a member of it is put into. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The table is the only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"way a directory group reaches an AXIAM group."}]},{"type":"text","text":" There is no match by name, no prefix or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wildcard, and no AXIAM group is ever created from a directory one: a directory administrator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"who names a group "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"admins"},{"type":"text","text":" gains nothing unless a tenant administrator mapped it here. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"DN is stored as the administrator typed it and compared after RFC 4514 normalisation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"axiam_directory::dn"},{"type":"text","text":"), so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CN=Staff, OU=Groups"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cn=staff,ou=groups"},{"type":"text","text":" are the same row."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"One DN may map to several AXIAM groups; the same (DN, group) pair twice is refused as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redundant."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GroupMapping"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping","role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping/encode(to:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/encode(to:)","title":"encode(to:)","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping\/encode(to:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"encode"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7EncoderP","text":"Encoder"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol"}}}